[{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:garden_of_rot","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"腐烂花园","titleEn":"Garden of Rot","rarity":"ultra","description":["一幅裸体自画像，卡米娜在其中描绘了一团从体内向外生长的腐烂黑暗。","· 被恶鸦群影响的逃生者完成驱赶动作后，会受到危险状态影响，持续4秒。","危险状态会使逃生者受到普通攻击时直接陷入濒死状态。"],"flavor":"“我在腐烂中看不到任何救赎。” —卡米娜·莫拉","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_gardenOfRot.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Garden_of_Rot","pinyin":"fulanhuayuan","initials":"flhy"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:iridescent_feather","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"荧虹羽毛","titleEn":"Iridescent Feather","rarity":"ultra","description":["由迷雾铸造出的玻璃状羽毛。虽然样式简单，但它是卡米娜的守护者的象征。","·当折磨鸦群处于冷却且无恐鸦被召唤时，艺术家会获得无法侦测状态。","·恐鸦最大数量减少1。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"“它们在我无力自救时拯救了我。”--卡米娜·莫拉","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentFeather.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Feather","pinyin":"yinghongyumao","initials":"yhym"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:severed_hands","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"切断的双手","titleEn":"Severed Hands","rarity":"very-rare","description":["卡米娜的双手，在她死前不久从她的手臂上砍了下来。","这幅景象让她自己和她的保护者都充满了怒火。","·逃生者被恐鸦包围时，其附近3米范围内的其他逃生者也会被包围。"],"flavor":"“看你现在还怎么画画？”——蒙面人","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_severedHands.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Severed_Hands","pinyin":"qieduandeshuangshou","initials":"qddss"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:severed_tongue","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"切断的舌头","titleEn":"Severed Tongue","rarity":"very-rare","description":["卡米娜的舌头，在她死前不久从她的口中割了下来。这幅景象让她自己和她的乌鸦都充满了怒火。","· 恐鸦起飞后，艺术家移动速度减慢的时间减少0.5秒"],"flavor":"“看你现在还怎么念诗？”——蒙面人","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_severedTongue.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Severed_Tongue","pinyin":"qieduandeshetou","initials":"qddst"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:ink_egg","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"墨水蛋","titleEn":"Ink Egg","rarity":"very-rare","description":["一个不寻常的蛋，似乎只是一团半固体的墨水。","· 恐鸦最大数量增加1。","· 恐鸦从开始休眠到消散的时间减少2秒。"],"flavor":"“也许当我被黑暗包围的时候，它们才会视我为同类。” ——卡米娜·莫拉","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_inkEgg.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Ink_Egg","pinyin":"moshuidan","initials":"msd"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:matias_baby_shoes","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"马蒂亚斯的婴儿鞋","titleEn":"Matias' Baby Shoes","rarity":"very-rare","description":["这悲伤的物件会提醒卡米娜，雅各布仍然和她在一起并注视着她。","· 休眠恐鸦5米范围内的逃生者气场会显示3秒。"],"flavor":"“我们很快会再见，马蒂亚斯。”——卡米娜·莫拉","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_matiasBabyShoes.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Matias%27_Baby_Shoes","pinyin":"madiyasideyingerxie","initials":"mdysdyex"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:o_grief_o_lover","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"悲伤与爱人","titleEn":"O Grief, O Lover","rarity":"rare","description":["卡米娜前往死亡之跃前创作的一幅抽象墨水画。","·恐鸦群包围逃生者时会对其施加疲劳状态。","疲劳状态会使逃生者无法激活疲劳相关技能。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_oGriefOLover.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/O_Grief,_O_Lover","pinyin":"beishangyuairen","initials":"bsyar"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:darkest_ink","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"极黑墨水","titleEn":"Darkest Ink","rarity":"rare","description":["某种不自然的墨水，邪恶而黑暗，似乎会吸入周围的光线。","·恐鸦群包围逃生者时会对其施加障目状态。此效果在恐鸦群被逃生者驱赶后仍会持续15秒。","障目状态会使逃生者无法看到气场。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_darkestInk.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Darkest_Ink","pinyin":"jiheimoshui","initials":"jhms"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:charcoal_stick","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"炭棒","titleEn":"Charcoal Stick","rarity":"rare","description":["一根炭棒，能掩盖它擦过的任何东西。","·恐鸦气场在飞行时不再可见。","·恐鸦被召唤后气场在0.5秒内可见。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_charcoalStick.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Charcoal_Stick","pinyin":"tanbang","initials":"tb"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:thorny_nest","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"荆棘鸟巢","titleEn":"Thorny Nest","rarity":"rare","description":["卡米娜的家附近仍然空着的鸟巢。里面嵌着锋利的棘刺。","· 被恐鸦伤害的逃生者会受到出血与重伤状态影响，持续70秒。","出血状态会使治疗进度在中断治疗后回退，并使受伤逃生者留下的血迹增加。该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。</>"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_thornyNest.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Thorny_Nest","pinyin":"jingjiniaochao","initials":"jjnc"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:silver_bell","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"银铃","titleEn":"Silver Bell","rarity":"rare","description":["被某只乌鸦看上的闪亮饰品。当啷的铃声会让卡米娜之外的所有人分心。","· 恐鸦群包围逃生者时会对其施加浑然不觉状态。","浑然不觉状态会使逃生者无法听到或受到杀手的恐惧范围影响。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_silverBell.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Silver_Bell","pinyin":"yinling","initials":"yl"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:velvet_fabric","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"天鹅绒布料","titleEn":"Velvet Fabric","rarity":"uncommon","description":["卡米娜对某个艺术项目使用的醒目红色布料。它的鲜艳程度与黑色羽毛形成了鲜明对比。","·逃生者试图驱散恐鸦群时，鸦群气场在额外1.5秒内仍可见。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_velvetFabric.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Velvet_Fabric","pinyin":"tianerongbuliao","initials":"terbl"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:untitled_agony","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"无题痛苦","titleEn":"Untitled Agony","rarity":"uncommon","description":["马蒂亚斯死后，一块被人用黑漆刷了又刷的画布。它散发着沉重而残缺的悲伤。","·恐鸦群包围逃生者时会对其施加15%减速状态，持续1.5秒。","减速状态降低逃生者移动速度。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_untitledAgony.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Untitled_Agony","pinyin":"wutitongku","initials":"wttk"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:festering_carrion","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"溃烂腐肉","titleEn":"Festering Carrion","rarity":"uncommon","description":["一堆令人作呕的内脏血肉，然而却吸引了饥饿的乌鸦前来啄食。","· 恐鸦起飞后，折磨鸦群的冷却时间减少0.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_festeringCarrion.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Festering_Carrion","pinyin":"kuilanfurou","initials":"klfr"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:automatic_drawing","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"自动绘画","titleEn":"Automatic Drawing","rarity":"uncommon","description":["卡米娜在没有确切计划的情况下进行的实验性绘画。不必思考——直接行动。","· 恐鸦休眠消散后，折磨鸦群的冷却时间缩短1.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_automaticDrawing.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Automatic_Drawing","pinyin":"zidonghuihua","initials":"zdhh"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:still_life_crow","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"静物乌鸦","titleEn":"Still Life Crow","rarity":"uncommon","description":["描绘死乌鸦的墨水画。通过每根黑暗线条都可以感受到卡米娜对其死亡的悲伤。","·恐鸦从开始休眠到消散的时间增加4秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_stillLifeCrow.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Still_Life_Crow","pinyin":"jingwuwuya","initials":"jwwy"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:choclo_corn","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"南美玉米","titleEn":"Choclo Corn","rarity":"common","description":["南美常见的玉米。只要几粒就足以让乌鸦停下来饱餐一顿了。","· 恐鸦从开始休眠到消散的时间增加2秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_chocloCorn.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Choclo_Corn","pinyin":"nanmeiyumi","initials":"nmym"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:oil_paints","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"油性颜料","titleEn":"Oil Paints","rarity":"common","description":["除了几团黑色和灰色，几乎没有留下什么，然而卡米娜仍然可以用它们画出一幅广阔的风景。","·恐鸦的杀手本能侦测范围增加1.5米。","杀手本能会间歇性显示逃生者的位置。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_oilPaints.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Oil_Paints","pinyin":"youxingyanliao","initials":"yxyl"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:vibrant_obituary","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"鲜艳讣告","titleEn":"Vibrant Obituary","rarity":"common","description":["废旧的报纸上斑斑点点地涂着鲜艳夺目的颜料。似乎悲剧已经成了日常新闻。","·恐鸦的杀手本能显示逃生者的时长增加3秒。","杀手本能会间歇性显示逃生者的位置。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_vibrantObituary.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Vibrant_Obituary","pinyin":"xianyanfugao","initials":"xyfg"},{"id":"addon:birds_of_torment:thick_tar","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-26","title":"黏稠焦油","titleEn":"Thick Tar","rarity":"common","description":["卡米娜用于一件实验作品的黏稠污泥。粘在皮肤上之后几乎不可能去除掉。","·逃生者驱赶恐鸦群所需时间增加0.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_thickTar.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Thick_Tar","pinyin":"nianchoujiaoyou","initials":"ncjy"}]
